the-firm-as-one-program-17 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-17 = unlines (cons "- **P6** Machines, operating systems and fleets as one program through composed handlers (hyperactivity v31 §7)." (cons "  A processor, a kernel, its guest processes, a network and a fleet of communicating machines are processes with explicit transitions. Composing them with handlers internalizes the interactions between them, so a kernel with its guests, or an entire fleet, is a single program whose properties can be proved. Continuing processes, with their divergence, deadlock and resource bounds, have exact semantics (hyperactivity v31 §7)." nil))
